  "title": "Swipe actions",
  "group": "Microinteractions",
  "order": 9,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Swipe a list row left to reveal its actions; swipe far or flick to run the last one, and the row slides out and closes its space. The row follows the finger exactly, and the same actions open with the Left arrow key.",
    "id": "Swipe baris daftar ke kiri untuk menampilkan aksinya; swipe jauh atau sentil cepat untuk menjalankan aksi terakhir, lalu baris meluncur keluar dan ruangnya menutup. Baris mengikuti jari dengan tepat, dan aksi yang sama terbuka dengan tombol panah kiri."
  },
  "titleId": "Swipe actions",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Inbox rows",
        "desc": "Drag a row left. Past half the actions it stays open; past 60 % of the row, or with a fast flick, Delete runs and the row slides out. Only one row is open at a time. Keyboard: focus a row and press the Left arrow.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Pin</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Archive</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Pothole report answered</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Two notes from the field officer</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">09:41</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Pin</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Archive</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">KTP-el recording moved</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Now at the kecamatan office, floor 2</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">Yesterday</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Pin</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Archive</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Business permit ready to collect</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Collect before Friday</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">Mon</span></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe>\n    <div class=\"swipe__actions\">\n      <button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Pin</button>\n      <button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\">…</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { toast } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  document.addEventListener('lds:swipe', (e) => {\n    if (e.detail.action !== 'delete') return;\n    toast({ title: 'Message deleted', action: 'Undo', onAction: () => { e.detail.restore(); return { title: 'Restored' }; } });\n  });\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "One action",
        "desc": "A task list with only Delete. A short swipe shows it; a long one deletes.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Photocopy the family card (KK)</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Business permit requirement</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">Today</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Pay motor vehicle tax</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Rp 450.000</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">Tomorrow</span></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Baris kotak masuk",
        "desc": "Tarik sebuah baris ke kiri. Lewat dari setengah lebar aksi, baris tetap terbuka; lewat 60 % lebar baris, atau dengan sentilan cepat, Hapus berjalan dan baris meluncur keluar. Hanya satu baris yang terbuka dalam satu waktu. Keyboard: fokus ke baris lalu tekan panah kiri.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Sematkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Arsipkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Laporan jalan berlubang ditanggapi</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Dua catatan dari petugas lapangan</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">09.41</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Sematkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Arsipkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Lokasi rekam KTP-el pindah</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Kini di kantor kecamatan, lantai 2</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">Kemarin</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Sematkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Arsipkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button></div><div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Dokumen izin usaha siap diambil</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Ambil sebelum hari Jumat</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">Sen</span></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"list\">\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe>\n    <div class=\"swipe__actions\">\n      <button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--gray\" data-swipe=\"pin\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">keep</span>Sematkan</button>\n      <button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"swipe__row lrow\" tabindex=\"0\">…</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { toast } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  document.addEventListener('lds:swipe', (e) => {\n    if (e.detail.action !== 'delete') return;\n    toast({ title: 'Pesan dihapus', action: 'Urungkan', onAction: () => { e.detail.restore(); return { title: 'Dipulihkan' }; } });\n  });\n</script>"
      },
